025-05-03 16:30:40',_binary '\0',1),(2762,1781604279872581776,2761,1,17,'assistant','MiniMax-Text-01',51,'北京目前的天气情况如下：\n\n- **温度**: 21°C\n- **天气状况**: 小雪\n- **湿度**: 66%\n- **风速**: 6 km/h\n\n如果你有其他问题或需要更多信息，请告诉我！','',_binary '','',NULL,NULL,'1','2025-05-03 16:30:40',NULL,'2025-05-03 16:30:45',_binary '\0',1),(2763,1781604279872581776,NULL,1,17,'user','MiniMax-Text-01',51,'查询我的个人信息 userprofile','',_binary '','',NULL,NULL,'1','2025-05-03 16:31:08','1','2025-05-03 16:31:08',_binary '\0',1),(2764,1781604279872581776,2763,1,17,'assistant','MiniMax-Text-01',51,'\n### Error querying database.  Cause: java.lang.NullPointerException: TenantContextHolder 不存在租户编号！可参考文档：https://doc.iocoder.cn\n### Cause: java.lang.NullPointerException: TenantContextHolder 不存在租户编号！可参考文档：https://doc.iocoder.cn','',_binary '','',NULL,NULL,'1','2025-05-03 16:31:08',NULL,'2025-05-03 16:31:14',_binary '\0',1),(2765,1781604279872581776,NULL,1,17,'user','MiniMax-Text-01',51,'查询我的个人信息 userprofile','',_binary '','',NULL,NULL,'1','2025-05-03 16:32:41','1','2025-05-03 16:32:41',_binary '\0',1),(2766,1781604279872581776,2765,1,17,'assistant','MiniMax-Text-01',51,'您的个人信息如下：\n\n- **昵称**: 芋道源码\n- **手机号**: 18818260277\n- **头像**: ![头像](http://test.yudao.iocoder.cn/test/20250502/avatar_1746154660449.png)\n\n如果您需要进一步的信息或者有任何疑问，请告诉我！','',_binary '','',NULL,NULL,'1','2025-05-03 16:32:41',NULL,'2025-05-03 16:32:59',_binary '\0',1),(2767,1781604279872581777,NULL,1,11,'user','qwen-72b-chat',14,'1','',_binary '','',NULL,NULL,'1','2025-05-03 17:00:12','1','2025-05-03 17:49:52',_binary '',1),(2768,1781604279872581777,2767,1,11,'assistant','qwen-72b-chat',14,'401 Unauthorized from POST https://dashscope.aliyuncs.com/api/v1/services/aigc/text-generation/generation','',_binary '','188,195,189,184,183,185,186,196,187,194',NULL,NULL,'1','2025-05-03 17:00:12','1','2025-05-03 17:49:51',_binary '',1),(2769,1781604279872581777,NULL,1,11,'user','MiniMax-Text-01',51,'1','',_binary '','',NULL,NULL,'1','2025-05-03 17:00:29','1','2025-05-03 17:48:02',_binary '',1),(2770,1781604279872581777,2769,1,11,'assistant','MiniMax-Text-01',51,'### 配置 Seata 进行分布式事务管理\n\nSeata 是一个开源的分布式事务解决方案，旨在解决微服务架构中的数据一致性问题。以下是详细的步骤，帮助你在项目中集成和使用 Seata：\n\n---\n\n### 一、创建 Seata 子模块\n\n1. **创建子模块**：\n   - 在你的 `yudao-framework` 模块下，新建一个子模块，命名为 `yudao-spring-boot-starter-seata`。\n\n2. **引入依赖**：\n   在 `yudao-spring-boot-starter-seata` 模块的 `pom.xml` 文件中，添加以下依赖：\n   ```xml\n   <dependencies>\n       <!-- 通用模块 -->\n       <dependency>\n           <groupId>cn.iocoder.cloud</groupId>\n           <artifactId>yudao-common</artifactId>\n           <version>2.3.0-SNAPSHOT</version>\n       </dependency>\n\n       <!-- Seata 依赖 -->\n       <dependency>\n           <groupId>com.alibaba.cloud</groupId>\n           <artifactId>spring-cloud-alibaba-seata</artifactId>\n           <version>2023.0.1.2</version>\n       </dependency>\n       <dependency>\n           <groupId>io.seata</groupId>\n           <artifactId>seata-spring-boot-starter</artifactId>\n           <version>1.8.0</version>\n           <exclusions>\n               <exclusion>\n                   <groupId>log4j</groupId>\n                   <artifactId>log4j</artifactId>\n               </exclusion>\n           </exclusions>\n       </dependency>\n       <dependency>\n           <groupId>io.seata</groupId>\n           <artifactId>seata-all</artifactId>\n           <version>1.8.0</version>\n           <exclusions>\n               <exclusion>\n                   <groupId>log4j</groupId>\n                   <artifactId>log4j</artifactId>\n               </exclusion>\n           </exclusions>\n       </dependency>\n       <dependency>\n           <groupId>io.protostuff</groupId>\n           <artifactId>protostuff-core</artifactId>\n           <version>1.7.2</version>\n       </dependency>\n       <dependency>\n           <groupId>io.protostuff</groupId>\n           <artifactId>protostuff-runtime</artifactId>\n           <version>1.7.2</version>\n       </dependency>\n   </dependencies>\n   ```\n\n---\n\n### 二、部署 Seata 服务端\n\n1. **下载并配置 Seata**：\n   - 下载 Seata Server 2.0.0 版本的 Windows 版。\n   - 配置 `seata\\conf\\application.yml` 文件：\n     ```yaml\n     server:\n       port: 7091\n\n     spring:\n       application:\n         name: seata-server\n\n     logging:\n       config: classpath:logback-spring.xml\n       file:\n         path: ${log.home:${user.home}/logs/seata}\n       extend:\n         logstash-appender:\n           destination: 127.0.0.1:4560\n         kafka-appender:\n           bootstrap-servers: 127.0.0.1:9092\n           topic: logback_to_logstash\n\n     console:\n       user:\n         username: seata\n         password: seata\n\n     seata:\n       config:\n         type: nacos\n         nacos:\n           server-addr: 192.168.1.146:8848\n           namespace: zma-dev\n           group: SEATA_GROUP\n           username: nacos\n           password: nacos\n           data-id: seataServer.properties\n       registry:\n         type: nacos\n         nacos:\n           application: seata-server\n           server-addr: 192.168.1.146:8848\n           group: SEATA_GROUP\n           namespace: zma-dev\n           cluster: default\n           username: nacos\n           password: nacos\n     ```\n     - 在 Nacos 配置中心，创建一个 `seataServer.properties` 文件，内容如下：\n       ```properties\n       service.enableDegrade=false\n       service.disableGlobalTransaction=false\n       service.vgroupMapping.default-tx-group=default\n       service.vgroupMapping.order-service-group=default\n       ```\n\n2. **启动 Seata Server**：\n   - 在 `seata\\bin` 目录下，双击 `seata-server.bat` 启动 Seata Server。\n   - 确认 Seata Server 是否启动成功，可以通过访问管理页面 `http://localhost:7091` 进行验证。\n\n---\n\n### 三、在微服务中配置 Seata\n\n1. **添加依赖**：\n   在每个需要使用 Seata 的微服务的 `pom.xml` 中，添加以下依赖：\n   ```xml\n   <dependency>\n       <groupId>cn.iocoder.cloud</groupId>\n       <artifactId>yudao-spring-boot-starter-seata</artifactId>\n       <version>2.3.0-SNAPSHOT</version>\n   </dependency>\n   ```\n\n2. **配置 Seata**：\n   在微服务的 `application.yml` 中，添加以下配置：\n   ```yaml\n   seata:\n     application-id: ${spring.application.name}\n     tx-service-group: default-tx-group\n     service:\n       vgroup-mapping:\n         default-tx-group: default\n     registry:\n       type: nacos\n       nacos:\n         cluster: default\n         namespace: zma-dev\n         serverAddr: localhost:8848\n         group: SEATA_GROUP\n         username: nacos\n         password: nacos\n   ```\n\n3. **启用 Seata 自动代理**：\n   在微服务的启动类上，添加以下注解：\n   ```java\n   @EnableAutoDataSourceProxy\n   @EnableFeignClients(defaultConfiguration = SeataFeignClientAutoConfiguration.class)\n   ```\n\n---\n\n### 四、测试全局事务\n\n1. **编写测试接口**：\n   在 `TenantController` 中，编写一个测试接口：\n   ```java\n   @GetMapping(\"/test-seata\")\n   @Operation(summary = \"测试seata\")\n   public CommonResult testSeata() {\n       return success(menuService.testSeata());\n   }\n   ```\n\n2. **实现业务逻辑**：\n   在 `menuService` 中，添加业务逻辑并使用 `@GlobalTransactional` 注解：\n   ```java\n   @Override\n   @GlobalTransactional(name = \"testSeata\", rollbackFor = Exception.class)\n   public Object testSeata() {\n       MenuDO menuDO = menuMapper.selectById(2815);\n       menuDO.setName(\"测试111\");\n       menuMapper.updateById(menuDO);\n\n       // 远程调用其他微服务\n       Boolean bool = apiErrorLogApi.testSeata();\n       Boolean common = apiErrorLogApi.testSeata2();\n\n       return true;\n   }\n   ```\n\n3. **注意事项**：\n   - 全局事务中，远程调用的方法不能返回 `CommonResult`，应直接返回实体数据。\n   - 远程调用的方法中不能有 `try-catch` 语句，否则事务不会生效。\n\n4. **添加 Seata 事务表**：\n   在每个数据库中，添加 `undo_log` 表：\n   ```sql\n   CREATE TABLE `undo_log` (\n     `id` bigint NOT NULL AUTO_INCREMENT,\n     `branch_id` bigint NOT NULL,\n     `xid` varchar(100) NOT NULL,\n     `context` varchar(128) NOT NULL,\n     `rollback_info` longblob NOT NULL,\n     `log_status` int NOT NULL,\n     `log_created` datetime NOT NULL,\n     `log_modified` datetime NOT NULL,\n     `ext` varchar(100) DEFAULT NULL,\n     PRIMARY KEY (`id`),\n     UNIQUE KEY `ux_undo_log` (`xid`,`branch_id`)\n   ) ENGINE=InnoDB AUTO_INCREMENT=23 DEFAULT CHARSET=utf8mb3;\n   ```\n\n5. **启动服务并测试**：\n   - 启动 `gateway`, `system` 微服务与 `infra` 微服务。\n   - 使用 Postman 请求 `/test-seata` 接口，验证数据库中的数据是否回滚。\n\n---\n\n### 总结\n\n通过以上步骤，你可以在项目中成功集成 Seata，实现分布式事务管理。这不仅能确保数据一致性，还能提高系统的稳定性和可靠性。','',_binary '','188,195,189,184,183,185,186,196,187,194',NULL,NULL,'1','2025-05-03 17:00:29','1','2025-05-03 17:48:04',_binary '',1),(2771,1781604279872581777,NULL,1,11,'user','MiniMax-Text-01',51,'1','',_binary '','',NULL,NULL,'1','2025-05-03 17:47:14','1','2025-05-03 17:47:55',_binary '',1),(2772,1781604279872581777,2771,1,11,'assistant','MiniMax-Text-01',51,'Operation timed out','',_binary '','188,195,189,184,183,185,186,196,187,194',NULL,NULL,'1','2025-05-03 17:47:14','1','2025-05-03 17:47:52',_binary '',1),(2773,1781604279872581777,NULL,1,11,'user','MiniMax-Text-01',51,'1','',_binary '','',NULL,NULL,'1','2025-05-03 17:50:15','1','2025-05-03 17:52:00',_binary '',1),(2774,1781604279872581777,2773,1,11,'assistant','MiniMax-Text-01',51,'','',_binary '','188,195,189,184,183,185,186,196,187,194',NULL,NULL,'1','2025-05-03 17:50:15','1','2025-05-03 17:51:58',_binary '',1),(2775,1781604279872581777,NULL,1,11,'user','MiniMax-Text-01',51,'1','',_binary '','',NULL,NULL,'1','2025-05-03 17:52:08','1','2025-05-03 17:56:36',_binary '',1),(2776,1781604279872581777,2775,1,11,'assistant','MiniMax-Text-01',51,'要创建和使用 Seata 来管理分布式事务，可以按照以下步骤进行：\n\n### 一、创建 Seata 子模块\n\n1. **在项目中添加 Seata 子模块**：\n   - 在 `yudao-framework` 模块下新建一个子模块，命名为 `yudao-spring-boot-starter-seata`。\n   - 在该子模块的 `pom.xml` 文件中添加以下依赖：\n     ```xml\n     <dependency>\n         <groupId>cn.iocoder.cloud</groupId>\n         <artifactId>yudao-common</artifactId>\n         <version>2.3.0-SNAPSHOT</version>\n     </dependency>\n     <dependency>\n         <groupId>com.alibaba.cloud</groupId>\n         <artifactId>spring-cloud-alibaba-seata</artifactId>\n         <version>2023.0.1.2</version>\n     </dependency>\n     <dependency>\n         <groupId>io.seata</groupId>\n         <artifactId>seata-spring-boot-starter</artifactId>\n         <!-- 注意不要使用2.0.0版本，因为事务不生效有bug -->\n         <version>1.8.0</version>\n     </dependency>\n     <dependency>\n         <groupId>io.seata</groupId>\n         <artifactId>seata-all</artifactId>\n         <!-- 注意不要使用2.0.0版本，因为事务不生效有bug -->\n         <version>1.8.0</version>\n         <exclusions>\n             <exclusion>\n                 <groupId>log4j</groupId>\n                 <artifactId>log4j</artifactId>\n             </exclusion>\n         </exclusions>\n     </dependency>\n     <dependency>\n         <groupId>io.seata</groupId>\n         <artifactId>seata-spring-autoconfigure-client</artifactId>\n         <!-- 注意不要使用2.0.0版本，因为事务不生效有bug -->\n         <version>1.8.0</version>\n     </dependency>\n     <dependency>\n         <groupId>com.caucho</groupId>\n         <artifactId>hessian</artifactId>\n         <version>4.0.63</version>\n     </dependency>\n     <dependency>\n         <groupId>io.protostuff</groupId>\n         <artifactId>protostuff-core</artifactId>\n         <version>1.7.2</version>\n     </dependency>\n     <dependency>\n         <groupId>io.protostuff</groupId>\n         <artifactId>protostuff-runtime</artifactId>\n         <version>1.7.2</version>\n     </dependency>\n     ```\n\n### 二、部署 Seata 服务端\n\n1. **配置 Seata**：\n   - 打开 `seata\\conf\\application.yml` 文件，进行如下配置：\n     ```yaml\n     server:\n       port: 7091\n\n     spring:\n       application:\n         name: seata-server\n\n     logging:\n       config: classpath:logback-spring.xml\n       file:\n         path: ${log.home:${user.home}/logs/seata}\n       extend:\n         logstash-appender:\n           destination: 127.0.0.1:4560\n         kafka-appender:\n           bootstrap-servers: 127.0.0.1:9092\n           topic: logback_to_logstash\n\n     console:\n       user:\n         username: seata\n         password: seata\n\n     seata:\n       config:\n         type: nacos\n         nacos:\n           server-addr: 192.168.1.146:8848\n           namespace: zma-dev\n           group: SEATA_GROUP\n           username: nacos\n           password: nacos\n           data-id: seataServer.properties\n       registry:\n         type: nacos\n         nacos:\n           application: seata-server\n           server-addr: 192.168.1.146:8848\n           group: SEATA_GROUP\n           namespace: zma-dev\n           cluster: default\n           username: nacos\n           password: nacos\n     ```\n   - 在 Nacos 配置中心中创建 `seataServer.properties` 文件，内容如下：\n     ```\n     service.enableDegrade=false\n     service.disableGlobalTransaction=false\n     service.vgroupMapping.default-tx-group=default\n     service.vgroupMapping.order-service-group=default\n     ```\n\n2. **启动 Seata 服务端**：\n   - 在 `seata\\bin` 目录下，双击 `seata-server.bat` 文件启动 Seata 服务端。\n   - 启动成功后，可以在 Nacos 中查看是否存在 `seata-server` 服务，或者访问 Seata 管理页面地址 `http://localhost:7091` 来确认。\n\n### 三、在微服务中配置 Seata\n\n1. **添加依赖**：\n   - 在每个微服务的 `pom.xml` 文件中添加以下依赖：\n     ```xml\n     <dependency>\n         <groupId>cn.iocoder.cloud</groupId>\n         <artifactId>yudao-spring-boot-starter-seata</artifactId>\n         <version>2.3.0-SNAPSHOT</version>\n     </dependency>\n     ```\n\n2. **配置 Seata**：\n   - 在微服务的 `application.yml` 文件中添加以下配置：\n     ```yaml\n     seata:\n       application-id: ${spring.application.name}\n       tx-service-group: default-tx-group\n       service:\n         vgroup-mapping:\n           default-tx-group: default\n       registry:\n         type: nacos\n         nacos:\n           cluster: default\n           namespace: zma-dev\n           serverAddr: localhost:8848\n           group: SEATA_GROUP\n           username: nacos\n           password: nacos\n     ```\n\n3. **启用 Seata**：\n   - 在微服务的启动类上添加以下注解：\n     ```java\n     @EnableAutoDataSourceProxy\n     @EnableFeignClients(defaultConfiguration = SeataFeignClientAutoConfiguration.class)\n     ```\n\n### 四、测试全局事务\n\n1. **编写测试接口**：\n   - 在 `TenantController` 中添加一个测试接口：\n     ```java\n     @GetMapping(\"/test-seata\")\n     @Operation(summary = \"测试seata\")\n     public CommonResult testSeata() {\n         return success(menuService.testSeata());\n     }\n     ```\n\n2. **实现业务方法**：\n   - 在 `menuService` 的业务实现方法上添加 `@GlobalTransactional` 注解：\n     ```java\n     @Override\n     @GlobalTransactional(name = \"testSeata\", rollbackFor = Exception.class)\n     public Object testSeata() {\n         MenuDO menuDO = menuMapper.selectById(2815);\n         menuDO.setName(\"测试111\");\n         menuMapper.updateById(menuDO);\n         \n         Boolean bool = apiErrorLogApi.testSeata();\n         Boolean common = apiErrorLogApi.testSeata2();\n         \n         return true;\n     }\n     ```\n   - 注意：远程调用的方法不能返回 `CommonResult`，而应返回实体数据，否则事务不生效。\n\n3. **添加 Seata 表**：\n   - 在每个数据库中添加 `undo_log` 表：\n     ```sql\n     CREATE TABLE `undo_log` (\n       `id` bigint NOT NULL AUTO_INCREMENT,\n       `branch_id` bigint NOT NULL,\n       `xid` varchar(100) NOT NULL,\n       `context` varchar(128) NOT NULL,\n       `rollback_info` longblob NOT NULL,\n       `log_status` int NOT NULL,\n       `log_created` datetime NOT NULL,\n       `log_modified` datetime NOT NULL,\n       `ext` varchar(100) DEFAULT NULL,\n       PRIMARY KEY (`id`),\n       UNIQUE KEY `ux_undo_log` (`xid`,`branch_id`)\n     ) ENGINE=InnoDB AUTO_INCREMENT=23 DEFAULT CHARSET=utf8mb3;\n     ```\n\n4. **启动微服务**：\n   - 启动 `gateway`, `system` 微服务与 `infra` 微服务。\n\n5. **测试事务**：\n   - 使用 Postman 请求 `system` 微服务中的 `/test-seata` 接口，观察数据库中的数据是否有回滚，是否有同步成功或失败。\n\n通过以上步骤，您可以在项目中集成 Seata，实现分布式事务管理。','',_binary '','188,195,189,184,183,185,186,196,187,194',NULL,NULL,'1','2025-05-03 17:52:08','1','2025-05-03 17:56:34',_binary '',1),(2777,1781604279872581777,NULL,1,11,'user','MiniMax-Text-01',51,'1','',_binary '','',NULL,NULL,'1','2025-05-03 17:56:08','1','2025-05-03 17:56:33',_binary '',1),(2778,1781604279872581777,2777,1,11,'assi